# Root-level scratch docs and plans only. Leading slash matters: a bare `docs/`
# also swallows source directories such as backend-rs/crates/backend/src/docs/,
# whose markdown is include_str!'d into the binary.
# GROUP_SCHEDULER.md is the tracked scheduler design doc referenced from the READMEs.
/docs/*
!/docs/GROUP_SCHEDULER.md
llm_config-for-test.txt
*.html
.workbuddy/
