# Per-workspace runtime state. Currently only ever holds logs, which `*.log`
# already covers, but the directory is the app's to write into. `.ag-swarmer/`
# is the pre-rename name, kept so old workspaces stay ignored.
.qunica/
.ag-swarmer/
